  ID: 39698b3f-da92-4bc6-bfb5-645a98386e45
  Status: test
  Level: critical
  Author: elhoim
  Date: 2022-09-09
  Description: Detects suspicious computer name samtheadmin-{1..100}$ generated by hacktool
